<title>NORWAY: Norway's April foreign trade surplus NOK 7.23 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's April foreign trade surplus NOK 7.23 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	APRIL 1997  MARCH 1997  APRIL 1996</p>
<p> Imports			     21.83	 17.66	  17.76</p>
<p> Exports			     29.07	 26.82	  25.72</p>
<p> Balance				7.23	  9.17	   7.96</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		 -6.73	 -5.62	  -5.09</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
